  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f1880f4f-939e-5d27-ab46-b83a46fc7b64" activityNameId="e19e77c8-51e5-511d-94a9-b6cd9f761113" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, Li-ions batteries, pyrometallurgical</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, Li-ions batteries, pyrometallurgical
The multioutput-process " pyrometallurgical treatment Li-ion batteries " delivers the co-products "disposal, Li-ion batteries, pyrometallurgical” ,” steel, pyrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant”, “Co powder, pyrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant”, “non-Fe-metals, pyrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant” and " MnO2 powder, pyrometallurgical processing Li-ion batteries, at plant ". The allocation is done 100% to the disposal process.;
UUID: 188856e2-076e-488a-b733-36d6f4cd400e
This dataset represents the treatment of Li-Ion batteries from electric and electronic devices by a pyrometallurgical process. It includes energy &amp; auxiliary consumption, waste production, emission (to air/to water) production and rough estimations of the efforts for infrastructure &amp; transportation.
Location: Data from a European recycling company - used as global average data.
Technology: Crushing of the batteries, followed by a neutralization and a processing step.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information &amp; own estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_188856e2-076e-488a-b733-36d6f4cd400e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
